      "message": "It looks like I cannot just move\n\ncc_library_shared {\n    name: \"android.hardware.audio.legacy@6.0-impl\",\n    defaults: [\"android.hardware.audio@6.0-impl_default\"],\n}\n\ninto our bp. It is too much burden for us to maintain the workaround.\n\nerror: device/generic/goldfish/audio/Android.bp:17:1: module \"android.hardware.audio.legacy@6.0-impl\" variant \"android_vendor.S_x86_64_sh\nared\": module source path \"device/generic/goldfish/audio/include\" does not exist\nerror: device/generic/goldfish/audio/Android.bp:17:1: module \"android.hardware.audio.legacy@6.0-impl\" variant \"android_vendor.S_x86_64_sh\nared\": module source path \"device/generic/goldfish/audio/Conversions.cpp\" does not exist",
