      "writtenOn": "2020-07-20T19:39:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, paths for target source files are relative to the .bp location, apologies I didn\u0027t consider that. But there should be a way to tell the build system that you need a particular target deployed under a different name. In this case there are no changes needed in this .bp file.",
      "parentUuid": "cc5e71bd_964fd9ec",
